eah, because we talked about that."},{"p":187,"b":4,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"That's correct, because --"},{"p":187,"b":5,"s":"MS.","x":"You did it [for a unintelligible .]"},{"p":187,"b":6,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Yeah, that's right."},{"p":187,"b":7,"s":"MS.","x":"And then Red came in."},{"p":187,"b":8,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Then Red came."},{"p":187,"b":9,"s":"MS.","x":"And Red heard you so he asked you to stay with him."},{"p":187,"b":10,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"That's right. I went with Red to Chicago, then after Chicago I went into the Army. That's the way it happened. Yeah."},{"p":187,"b":11,"s":"MS.","x":"Oh, is it? You didn't go back to --"},{"p":187,"b":12,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"No, I didn't go back."},{"p":187,"b":13,"s":"MS.","x":"-- 52nd Street?"},{"p":187,"b":14,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"No, because I left Chicago in --"},{"p":187,"b":15,"s":"MS.","x":"Well, wait a minute, Kenny, because you yourself had (Unintelligible) working for you."},{"p":187,"b":16,"s":"","x":"(Unintelligible)"},{"p":187,"b":17,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Yeah. That was around -- that was --"},{"p":187,"b":18,"s":"MS.","x":"What happened to Ike?"},{"p":187,"b":19,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Well, that was -- well, we had two tenors."},{"p":188,"b":0,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Two tenors. Yeah, we had Hawk and Ike."},{"p":188,"b":1,"s":"","x":"(Laughter)"},{"p":188,"b":2,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"You know?"},{"p":188,"b":3,"s":"MS.","x":"How about that. And then you went to Chicago with Red."},{"p":188,"b":4,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"With Red."},{"p":188,"b":5,"s":"MS.","x":"And that was Red and Higgy -- [J.C. Higginbotham]"},{"p":188,"b":6,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"And Don Stovéall."},{"p":188,"b":7,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah."},{"p":188,"b":8,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"General Morgan, the piano player."},{"p":188,"b":9,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah."},{"p":188,"b":10,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Benny Moton on bass."},{"p":188,"b":11,"s":"MS.","x":"Oh, yeah."},{"p":188,"b":12,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"That was the band."},{"p":188,"b":13,"s":"MS.","x":"That was the band."},{"p":188,"b":14,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"That was the band. Uh huh."},{"p":188,"b":15,"s":"MS.","x":"And where was it in Chicago?"},{"p":188,"b":16,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"At the Garrick Stage Lounge."},{"p":188,"b":17,"s":"MS.","x":"Oh."},{"p":188,"b":18,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"You know, down in the Loop."}]}